- Airc (https://github.com/red545/airc), Copyright 2026 The Airc Authors,
  Apache License 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
  - App/Sources/OpenArch/Browser/ShortTitles.swift adapts Airc's Tidy Titles
    (packages/AircKit/Sources/AircKit/AI/TidyTitles.swift and
    apps/browser/Sources/Airc/AI/AppleIntelligence.swift, commit 88fb3dd):
    the title rules, the prompt, the request queue with its timeout and the
    Foundation Models call. Changed for OpenArch.
  - App/Sources/OpenArch/Model/SafeStorage.swift: taking over the keychain
    item "OpenArch Safe Storage" (a copy that is read back before the old item
    is deleted, and put back after an interrupted take-over) follows Airc's
    apps/browser/Sources/Airc/App/SafeStorageKey.swift.

- Ardia (https://github.com/ardia-browser/ardia), Copyright 2026 Mantra Patel,
  Apache License 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0): Ardia's
  FairPlay bridges (commit 8a07d45). Changed for OpenArch.
  - Spotify's music. App/Sources/OpenArchFairPlay/main.swift adapts
    packages/ardiacore/fairplay/main.swift: the helper process with Apple's
    player, the key requests and Now Playing.
    App/Resources/BuiltinExtensions/openarch/fairplay.js adapts the FairPlay
    part of packages/ardiacore/ios/page_script.js: the key system offered to
    the page, the media element's answers and the playlist's hand-over.
    App/Sources/OpenArch/Browser/FairPlay.swift follows
    packages/ardiacore/ios/ArdiaFairPlay.mm: what a page may send, the
    helper's messages and its life cycle.
  - Netflix's and Disney+'s video. App/Sources/OpenArchProtectedVideo
    adapts packages/ardiacore/ios: ArdiaProtectedVideo.mm,
    ArdiaProtectedVideoInternal.h, ArdiaProtectedVideoMedia.mm,
    ArdiaPVSession*.mm (the sample-buffer player, its keys, buffers and
    Picture in Picture) and ArdiaVideoMirror.mm (the copy of the site's
    controls), with helpers from ArdiaRuntime.h, ArdiaWebView.mm and
    ArdiaSystemPictureInPicture.mm.
    App/Resources/ProtectedVideo/video_mirror.js is
    packages/ardiacore/ios/video_mirror.js, unchanged.
    App/Resources/BuiltinExtensions/openarch/protected-video.js adapts
    page_script.js: its protected video bridge and its video mirror.
    App/Resources/OptionalExtensions/safari-user-agent adapts
    packages/ardiacore/extensions/protected-video-ua.

